    "app.market.list", "app.market", "", "List files on the ZCL Market",
    "The admitted file offers in the bounded live cache, filtered through "
    "this node's own listing-visibility profile (per-node moderation: a "
    "hidden offer is kept and never deleted, but is neither listed nor "
    "served from here; relay is a separate rule). "
    "Every row carries its local review_state; the reply carries an honest "
    "hidden_count. The optional profile key (\"open\") is the explicit "
    "per-request override showing everything ingested. Paid rows have a "
    "seller-verified, network-bound offer_id, exact integer total, and "
    "expiry; legacy unsigned rows are price-zero recovery artifacts only.",
