ZCL_COMMAND_READY_READ(
    "app.market.moderation.status", "app.market.moderation", "",
    "Show this node's market moderation posture",
    "The node's own moderation posture: local review_state counts over "
    "stored offers plus the TWO independently-valued rules — serve_rule "
    "(what this node hands out; default general-audience.v1, reviewed_ok "
    "only) and relay_rule (whether it forwards other people's offer "
    "announcements; default relay-all.v1, yes). They have separate defaults "
    "and separate set commands, and neither moves the other. No "
    "network-wide bans and no deletion authority: a hidden offer stays "
    "stored with its signed wire intact and stays reachable from any node "
    "that does host it, and neither rule reaches block or transaction "
    "acceptance.", 0,
